com,"$Browns Sisler announced he would protest the game"
com,"because Ump Owens ruled that Rego should precede McMillan"
com,"in the batting order in the 9th, which Sisler declared"
com,"violated the rules. McMillan had run for Severeid in the"
com,"8th, remaining in the game at SS. The protest was upheld"
com,"and the game was declared a no-decision (all player stats"
com,"counted)."
